{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":68,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"7cbe72cd-5c2c-43cc-a7b7-ad16e07fb7c7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151180992,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人大客户销售经理（面板行业）","OrgId":1764284,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责所属地区的战略客户开发。包括机器人产品端的灯塔客户开发，维护现有客户关系，促成销售目标，达成销售业务；\n2、利用对面板行业敏锐的洞察力，能够快速识别目标潜力客户，可以针对各种客户类型做相关的方案并主导项目的达成；\n3、利用行业展会及论坛等推广公司产品，提升产品美誉度，扩大企业影响力，从各个维度促成营收目标的达成；\n4、根据公司产品和技术资源，开发新行业客户，配合市场部定义新产品；\n5、配合客户做项目售前可行性论证，以及项目实施进度跟进及资源协调；\n6、定期完成各项过程管理，包括不局限于CRM的填写及销售指标，不断提升产品的市场占有率。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，条件优秀者可放宽至大专，市场营销及自动化相关专业，工科专业优先；\n2、具备独立开发和维护市场的销售能力，熟悉工控行业。\n3、有面板行业工作经验，熟悉了解机器人在电子行业的应用场景，具备敏锐的洞察力，积累了相关行业资源。\n4、自律勤奋，责任心强，强烈的成就动机与自驱力 ；愿意不断挑战自己，勇于开拓；良好的仪表举止，热爱学习，心理素质佳，抗压能力强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-21T20:48:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"376c2d69-3e37-47d2-a0ab-0830847d119c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151164990,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人大客户经理（3C 电子方向）","OrgId":1764284,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责\n1.负责3C 电子行业工业机器人、协作机器人、自动化产线及集成解决方案的市场开拓、客户开发、商务谈判、订单签订、项目落地与回款全流程工作。\n2.聚焦手机、笔电、平板、穿戴、SMT、组装、测试、包装、精密加工等应用场景，挖掘客户在精密装配、锁螺丝、点胶、打磨、检测、搬运、AGV/AMR、3D 视觉等方向的自动化升级需求。\n3.深度拓展与维护3C 电子头部客户，包括电子等终端品牌及头部代工厂，建立长期稳定合作关系。\n4.联动公司内部方案、技术、交付、项目管理团队，输出定制化机器人解决方案，推动项目从需求对接、方案设计、打样验证到量产落地全周期运作。\n5.完成公司下达的销售业绩指标、毛利目标、回款计划，优化客户结构与区域市场布局。\n6.跟踪3C 电子自动化、工业机器人行业动态、竞品信息及市场趋势，制定并执行区域 / 行业销售策略。","Require":"1.大专及以上，机电、自动化、市场营销相关专业优先。\n2.3 年以上 3C 电子行业销售经验，必须有工业机器人 / 协作机器人 / 自动化设备销售背景。\n3.熟悉 3C 制造工艺：组装、测试、SMT、包装、精密加工等。\n4.自带 3C 行业客户资源或头部工厂人脉优先，能独立开拓大客户。\n5.熟悉协作机器人、工业机器人、AGV/AMR、3D 视觉 + 机器人方案者优先。\n6.具备优秀的商务谈判、项目运作、客户关系管理能力。\n7.能适应出差，抗压能力强，目标感强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-23T15:47:55","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"1d7f7692-eb3f-464b-bee2-2ebb04828e09","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151164979,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人销售经理（安徽）","OrgId":1764284,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、根据公司年度指标，负责机器人目标市场的调研与开拓； \n2、根据所负责地区的实际情况，制定销售策略并开发新客户； \n3、落实公司战略要求，负责区域渠道开发与建设；\n4、负责与技术工程师进行工作配合并行之有效的服务客户，为客户提供技术支持以及商务指导；\n5、了解行业需求，并能够为客户提供一定的行业技术解决方案； \n6、定期完成各项过程管理，包括不局限于CRM的填写及销售指标，不断提升产品的市场占有率。","Require":"任职资格：\n1、本科及以上学历，条件优秀者可放宽至大专，市场营销及自动化相关专业，工科专业优先；\n2、具备独立开发和维护市场的销售能力，熟悉工控行业；\n3、自律勤奋，责任心强，强烈的成就动机与自驱力 ；愿意不断挑战自己，勇于开拓；良好的仪表举止，热爱学习，心理素质佳，抗压能力强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-23T15:44:44","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"f9cce17a-5a26-485e-95c7-666b5fccef39","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151164847,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"软件专家(轴控)","OrgId":1764300,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责机器人系统底层基础运动轴控软件框架设计、开发和维护；\n2. 负责机器人轴控模块与外部应用接口设计开发，以及与底层总线接口的管理和维护；\n3. 负责参与机器人系统运动控制相关应用功能方案设计和评审；\n4. 协助进行系统集成测试与运动控制问题排查，配合优化机器人系统运动控制精度和性能；\n5. 基于 Linux 环境进行 C++ 代码编写、调试与性能优化；\n6. 参与编写技术文档、代码审查，确保代码质量与可维护性；","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，自动控制、机械电子工程、计算机科学、软件工程或相关专业背景，5 年以上工作经验，工业机器人或数控机床领域相关背景优先；\n2. 对 IEC 61131-3 标准、PLCopen Motion Control 相关标准有深入理解，对轴控有深度理解或有相关应用经验；了解 RTMotion、ROS2、Codesys 等涉及轴控框架者优先；\n3. 对伺服上下电过程、CiA 402 标准有深入理解，熟悉或开发设计过轴控状态机；\n4. 有多轴机器人控制系统开发经验，熟悉机器人动力学、运动学应用，熟悉理解轨迹规划以及轴插补原理，有相关算法工程化落地经验者优先；\n5. 精通 C++ 编程，熟悉 C++11/14/17 相关特性，具备良好的编码习惯和代码设计能力。\n6. 熟悉 Linux 开发环境，掌握 gcc / gdb / cmake / make 等工具链；\n7. 具备一定软件架构设计能力，熟悉常用软件设计模式；\n8. 具有良好的沟通能力和团队协作精神，能承担一定技术压力；\n9. 能用英语进行技术文档阅读和基本沟通。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-23T13:17:42","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"3b69c703-c2bc-4acf-8d93-b28b5b3d5281","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151123563,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人大客户销售经理(汽车行业)","OrgId":1764284,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"根据公司战略，拓展汽车主机及汽车零部件行业务，完成埃夫特机器人在华南汽车行业的的突破与布局。\n1、根据公司的战略分解经营指标，结合指定区域或指定行业的发展与趋势，制定区域或行业的业务规划；\n2、积极进行市场洞察，并为公司战略决策提供清晰的市场信息；\n3、负责所属地区的战略客户开发。包括机器人产品端的灯塔客户开发，维护现有客户关系，促成销售目标，达成销售业务；\n4、收集汽车主机及汽车零部件商机信息并做有效跟踪及落地，利用对汽车行业敏锐的洞察力，能够快速识别目标潜力客户，可以针对各种客户类型做相关的方案并主导项目的达成；\n5、利用行业展会及论坛等推广公司产品，提升产品美誉度，扩大企业影响力，从各个维度促成营收目标的达成；\n6、根据公司产品和技术资源，开发新行业客户，配合市场部定义新产品；\n7、完成年度目标客户的阶段性工作，包括：品牌导入，样机借测，批量订单等，以促成各项营销目标的达成，不断提升产品的市场占有率。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，条件优秀者可放宽至大专，市场营销及自动化相关专业，工科专业优先；\n2、具备独立开发和维护市场的销售能力，熟悉汽车及汽车零部件行业。\n3、有汽车行业工作经验，熟悉了解机器人在汽车行业的应用场景，具备敏锐的洞察力，积累了相关行业资源。\n3、自律勤奋，责任心强，强烈的成就动机与自驱力 ；愿意不断挑战自己，勇于开拓；良好的仪表举止，热爱学习，心理素质佳，抗压能力强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-07T16:31:12","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"d5e3049e-4973-487e-b5c6-bcdcdf5c6fd6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151088574,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"复合机器人-C++开发工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、行为树开发与维护：设计、实现和调试用于任务调度与决策的行为树节点和子树。\n2、控制逻辑实现：使用C++将具体的机器人任务（如“移动到某位置”、“抓取物体”、“视觉巡检”等）转化为可靠的行为树逻辑。\n3、系统集成：将导航、视觉、力控等算法模块的接口封装为行为树可调用的动作或条件节点，实现跨模块协同工作。\n4、代码与工具开发：编写高质量、可维护的C++代码，并可能参与开发用于行为树可视化、调试和测试的内部工具。\n5、测试与调试：在仿真环境（如Gazebo）和真实机器人上进行系统集成测试，定位并解决逻辑问题，确保任务执行的稳定性和鲁棒性。\n6、文档编写：撰写设计文档、API说明及使用案例，保障代码的清晰可理解。","Require":"1、学历与基础：计算机科学、机器人学、自动化或相关专业的本科及以上学历。\n2、编程能力：扎实的C++基础（C++11/14），理解面向对象编程、设计模式的基本思想，具备良好的编码习惯。\n3、核心技能：对行为树（Behavior Tree）架构有基本了解或强烈的学习意愿。有课程项目、个人项目或实习中相关经验者优先。\n4、机器人知识：了解机器人学的基本概念（如坐标系变换、传感器、执行器）优先。\n5、工具链熟悉度：熟悉Linux开发环境，掌握Git版本控制工具。\n6、团队与学习能力：优秀的逻辑思维能力、主动解决问题的能力，强烈的责任心和团队协作精神，对机器人技术充满热情并乐于快速学习。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-15T11:08:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"17914e02-5043-4708-b17f-abe874f8adb8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":150978148,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"精益工程师","OrgId":1764301,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责发起并实施全面的精益/CIP行动\n2. 负责精益改善，定制行动计划与实施100%；\n3.负责精益体系的建立，工厂产线布局优化与扩建；\n4. 制定工厂6S标准，组织审核并改进；\n5. 落实推进车间规划布局改革，跟踪验证效果，出具科学有力对比数据；\n6. 搭建标准化和模块化生产体系；\n7. 支持关键的精益计划，如TPM和首件通过率改进活动；\n8. 鼓励同事提出更多合理化的想法，并加以评估和实现；\n9.通过工作中的培训制定持续改进流程，以改变一线员工的心态。","Require":"1.  本科及以上学历；机械自动化、工业工程等相关专业；优秀者可放宽至大专学历；\n2. 5年及以上精益，CIP，IE相关行业工作背景优先；\n3. 熟练运用办公软件，及CAD、Solidworks；\n4.CET4优先, 具有较强的学习、独立工作能力强，并具有团队精神，有较强的沟通、协调能力，愿意接受挑战。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-01-17T14:57:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"e0d901ef-7584-4b21-9482-17f231419eba","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":150978109,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺师","OrgId":1764301,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":nul